# logs screen-alpine323 ----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Inferred from v0.3.2 and origin/main. The Logs screen. web-$
# 01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23, whose less is a link to$
# BusyBox (vm-runs/s1/01-tools.log). LESSSECURE=1 changes$
# nothing there: s still prompts Log file, E and :e Examine (vm-$
# runs/s1/04-less2-alpine323-vm.log). No path was typed at s, so$
# its write did not run; E did try a name that does not exist.$
# That s writes and E opens any path as root is read$
# (miscutils/less.c, master). So treatment pager-less gives it$
# no Open item (decision 7). With Alpine's less package there is$
# one (pager-commands).$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Size                 601 bytes$
$
# Last 4 of 10 lines -------------------------------------------$
$
      2026/10/20 12:00:04 WARNING: hardn's boot unit was not$
      | removed: exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      | exit status 1$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 INFO: Using configuration from:$
      | /etc/hardn/hardn.yml$
      2026/10/20 12:05:11 SUCCESS: debian trixie detected$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-1 or q]:$
$
